```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>Day 1 - Five Tags Challenge</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            max-width: 800px;
            margin: 20px auto;
            padding: 20px;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        mark {
            background-color: yellow;
        }

        blockquote {
            border-left: 4px solid #333;
            padding-left: 15px;
            font-style: italic;
        }

        code {
            background-color: #f4f4f4;
            padding: 2px 5px;
            border-radius: 3px;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <h1>Five Tags Challenge</h1>

    <h2>1. Abbreviation Tag</h2>
    <p>
        I am learning
        <abbr title="HyperText Markup Language">HTML</abbr>
        to build websites.
    </p>

    <h2>2. Blockquote and Cite Tags</h2>
    <blockquote>
        "Success is not final, failure is not fatal:
        it is the courage to continue that counts."
    </blockquote>
    <p>— <cite>Winston Churchill</cite></p>

    <h2>3. Code Tag</h2>
    <p>
        Example of HTML code:
        <code>&lt;h1&gt;Hello World&lt;/h1&gt;</code>
    </p>

    <h2>4. Mark Tag</h2>
    <p>
        My goal is to become a
        <mark>professional web developer</mark>.
    </p>

    <h2>5. Time Tag</h2>
    <p>
        Assignment completed on
        <time datetime="2026-06-23">June 23, 2026</time>.
    </p>

    <h2>6. Details and Summary Tags</h2>
    <details>
        <summary>Click to learn more about me</summary>
        <p>
            My name is Nahashon Mutahi. I am passionate about
            programming, web development, and technology.
        </p>
    </details>

</body>
</html>
```
